&amp; Poivre</div>\n          <div class=\"jade-ingredient-benefit\">Purifie et revitalise</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"jade-ingredient\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0909/0590/3477/files/ChatGPT_Image_9_janv._2026_00_28_21.png?v=1767915548\" alt=\"\">\n          <div class=\"jade-ingredient-name\">He Shou Wu</div>\n          <div class=\"jade-ingredient-benefit\">Soin traditionnel asiatique</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"jade-ingredient\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0909/0590/3477/files/ChatGPT_Image_9_janv._2026_00_27_48.png?v=1767915552\" alt=\"\">\n          <div class=\"jade-ingredient-name\">Noix de Coco</div>\n          <div class=\"jade-ingredient-benefit\">Nourrit et adoucit</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"jade-ingredient\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0909/0590/3477/files/ChatGPT_Image_9_janv._2026_00_31_03.png?v=1767915556\" alt=\"\">\n          <div class=\"jade-ingredient-name\">Thuya de Chine</div>\n          <div class=\"jade-ingredient-benefit\">Soin botanique du cuir chevelu</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"jade-ingredient\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0909/0590/3477/files/ChatGPT_Image_9_janv._2026_00_27_35.png?v=1767915545\" alt=\"\">\n          <div class=\"jade-ingredient-name\">Kératine</div>\n          <div class=\"jade-ingredient-benefit\">Renforce la fibre</div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</section>",
